-games-2pt5","sportsMarketType":"totals","groupItemTitle":"O/U 2.5 Games","line":2.5,"description":"This market refers to the Dota 2 match between CyberHero and Zero Tenacity in the EPL Masters Group B, initially scheduled for October 25, 2026 at 11:00 AM ET.\n\nThis market will resolve to \"Over\" if CyberHero and Zero Tenacity play 3 or more games in this series.\n\nIf fewer than 3 games are played, this market will resolve to \"Under\".\n\nGames won by forfeit, disqualification, walkover, or default are counted towards the total, provided that the match is completed.\n\nIf the match is canceled (not played at all for any reason) or ends in a tie, this market will resolve to 50-50.\n\nIf the match is postponed, it must be rescheduled to a start time on or before November 8, 2026 at 11:59 PM ET (14 calendar days after the originally scheduled start of October 25, 2026 at 11:00 AM ET). If, by that deadline, the most recently announced rescheduled start time is on or before the deadline, this market resolves based on the result of the match as played. Otherwise, this market resolves 50-50, regardless of whether the match is subsequently played.\n\nThe match is considered to have begun once live play begins in its first map or game. Warmup rounds and knife rounds do not count as the start of the match. A round forced live because a team did not ready up or resume play within the allotted time does not count as the start of the match if that team forfeits before the next round begins.\n\nIf the match begins and one team wins due to the opponent's match forfeiture, disqualification, or walkover, the match will count as completed.\n\nIn that case, any remaining games required to decide the match, including a game in progress or not yet started, will be counted as won by the winning team.\n\nIf the match ends due to the clinching game being forfeited this will count as a completed match.\n\nThe resolution source for this market will be official information from https://www.dotabuff.com. However, if https://www.dotabuff.com has not published final results within 2 hours after the event’s conclusion, a consensus of credible reporting may be used instead including video evidence.","resolutionSource":"https://www.dotabuff.com","outcomes":["Over","Under"],"prices":["0.495","0.505"],"clobTokenIds":["15910053245072057804052302539725168588550700851587820461205093169893512026731","26324992445227994683383919273909942736724794208063592921529842151238188529284"],"positionIds":["716832452096252056359632371785224121968801194950642180024202175202713403392","716832452096252056359632371785224121968801194950642180024202175202713403393"],"event_id":"1247545","event_title":"Dota 2: CyberHero vs Zero Tenacity (BO3) - EPL Masters Group B","event_slug":"dota2-ch1-z10-2026-10-25"},"combo_status":"available","combo_verified":true,"combo_verification_status":"verified","combo_verified_at":"2026-10-24T19:35:31.436Z","event_combo_status":"available","best_bid":0.03,"best_ask":0.96,"spread":0.9299999999999999,"ask_size":7.5,"ask_notional_usd":622.7102,"book_midpoint":0.495,"book_status":"available","book_observed_at":"2026-10-24T19:36:35.848Z","book_timestamp":"2026-10-24T19:36:12.575Z","depth":{"bid_shares":260,"ask_shares":635.07,"ask_notional_usd":622.7102},"book_age_ms_at_observation":23273,"min_order_size":"5","tick_size":"0.01"}
